{"id":"Wdf9ad376296cd685e4a2215c","zh":"Karhunen-Loève展开","en":"","name":"Karhunen-Loève展开","language":"zh","domain":"文献术语","concept_id":null,"families":[],"definition_zh":null,"definition_en":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_note":null,"usage_overview":null,"translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[],"designations":[{"id":"Wdf9ad376296cd685e4a2215c","text":"Karhunen-Loève展开","language":"zh","role":"headword"}],"complete_examples":[{"id":"Sf42d8f2de69c898c865a","source_id":"P111","page":1,"page_end":1,"language":"zh","text":"其中,横风由平均风和随机脉动风构成,考虑脉动风的空间相关性,采用谐波合成法模拟脉动风速,用Karhunen-Loève展开法把握脉动风的随机特征;采用轨道不平顺概率模型,生成轨道随机不平顺样本序列;通过将横风和轨道不平顺转化为相应的车辆- 轨道系统荷载矢量,从而建立用于风-轨道不平顺联合分析的车辆-轨道随机分析模型。","citations":[{"source_id":"P111","page":1,"page_end":1}]}],"sources":{"P057":{"id":"P057","title":"Random simulation method of track irregularities and its application in vehicle-track dynamic analysis","authors":"L Song, H Liu, L Xu, Z Yu","year":"2023","doi":"10.1080/23248378.2022.2069170","journal_citation":"International Journal of Rail Transportation 11 (2), 169-187","label":"Song等（2023）","overview_slug":"2023-random-simulation-method-of-track-irregularities-and-its-application-in-vehicle-track-dynamic-analys"},"P111":{"id":"P111","title":"横风和轨道不平顺联合作用下的车辆-轨道系统随机分析模型","authors":"徐磊,翟婉明","year":"2018","doi":"10.16385/j.cnki.issn.1004-4523.2018.01.005","journal_citation":"振动工程学报","label":"徐磊等（2018）","overview_slug":"2018-the-vehicle-track-stochastic-model-considering-joint-effects-of-cross-winds-and-track-random-irregul"}},"relations":[],"related_terms":[],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"suggested_comparisons":[],"contexts":[{"text":"通过相关矩阵特征分解表示风速过程并截取主要随机成分。","language":"zh","source_id":"P111","paper_slug":"2018-the-vehicle-track-stochastic-model-considering-joint-effects-of-cross-winds-and-track-random-irregul","title":"横风和轨道不平顺联合作用下的车辆-轨道系统随机分析模型","kind":"paper_usage"},{"text":"依据协方差特征分解，以有限空间模态和随机系数表示不平顺。","language":"zh","source_id"